{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Who Let The Bugs Out? Demo</strong> includes only the <strong>Auction</strong> mode of the game with limited upgrades choices, enemies variations, single level, and only one auction item to protect - the banana.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Auction</strong> mode is the main part of the game, so you can experience how actual game feels like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You get to protect the banana value from bugs and then look like it price grows with every bid when you successfully protected it until the auction start.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Action:</strong> Move strategically to protect the item while earning XP to keep up with the growing enemy threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade System:</strong> Earn XP and choose from a variety of random upgrades, allowing you to tailor your playstyle and overcome any challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Fresh Roguelike Twist:</strong> Unlike traditional roguelikes where enemies mindlessly attack, here the bugs grow cautious in your presence, turning their assault into a retreat.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3631730?t=1744118864","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3631730?t=1744118864","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631730/488dba6644869588e4b33f4338b4aab665c0b5c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744118864","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631730/488dba6644869588e4b33f4338b4aab665c0b5c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744118864","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"fu